  Well, it took a while, but I got it to work. Thanks to the people who
sent me mail. I forgot to write down your names, but the addresses are
xanthian@Zorch.SF-Bay.ORG and keni@dtix.dt.navy.mil. Thanks again!

  Someone wanted me to post a summary, so here it goes. First, save the
files out of rn (s nh1.1, s nh1.2, etc.) Next, edit the files with your
editor and remove up to and including the line that says 'cut here'. Do
this for each one. Now, sh each file. Cat each file (cat nh3.0i-1.zuu??
> zuufile1). Use uudecode on the zuufile1. Do the same for the other
side. Then download the nh3.0i-1.zoo and nh3.0i-2.zoo. Un zoo them on
your end, and you should have it.

  If I screwed up the method here, please correct it... I'm still a bit
hazy on it, but I could do it again with some practice.

